{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45294","headline":"奉酬陆使君见过各赋院中一物得江蓠 · 皎然","name":"奉酬陆使君见过各赋院中一物得江蓠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江蓠生古砌，花每落禅床。\n嘉客未采掇，空门自馨香。\n名因诗目见，色对道心忘。\n不遇陆内史，谁知殊衆芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}